      "year": 1242
    },
    "precision": "year",
    "uncertainty": {
      "note": "World History Encyclopedia gives 21 Dec 1237 (Ryazan), 7 Feb 1238 (Vladimir), 6 Dec 1240 (Kyiv) and 10-11 Apr 1241 (Mohi); National Geographic gives 'end of 1237', 'end of 1240' and April 11, 1241, with Ögedei dying in December 1241 and a spring 1242 retreat. The timeline lists a wider 1236-1242 span for the multi-army attack."
